# and is OFF — branch protection keeps required_approving_review_count = 0,
# because with one account a required review blocks every merge, and a second
# account of the same person is not independence. The day a verifier who is
# not the author exists (#14): replace the handle below with theirs, set
# required_approving_review_count = 1 with "require review from code owners",
